      "boundary": "Interactive public feature explorer with original fictional campaign photography. Embedded portfolio, real public catalogue deadlines, local notification switches, and clearly labelled resettable sample submissions. No private API write, delivery or publication. Existing app destinations retained. User-triggered motion with reduced-motion equivalent. Homepage preview starts with the White theme; five local theme choices remain interactive. Approved marketing-only forest, citron and sky surfaces use the scoped palette token chain."
    },
